   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida Alumni 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida Alumni Programme 2013 - UI 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida startar Alumni programet f&#xf6;r att bidra p&#xe5; annat s&#xe4;tt till att &#xf6;ka kunskapen om globala utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor, bist&#xe5;nd och det utvecklings land som studenter har skrivit sin Minor field Study uppsats.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal for Sida Communication 2013 is to increase and deepen  knowledge on International Development Cooperation -  amongst others  -  the youth. Sida Alumni estimate to reach more than 10000 people in 2013  mostly youth, with high quality lectures.Sida intends to        increase the knowledge, interest and engagement for aid an global     development issuses amongst young people.</narrative>
  </description>
